{"dct_title_s":"MassGIS 2000 Massachusetts Senate Legislative Districts (1993)","dct_description_sm":["Abstract: The Massachusetts State Senate Legislative Districts (1993) datalayer reflects the State Senate district boundaries as defined by Chapter 274 of the Acts of 1993. The name of the statewide datalayer is SENATE93. Names of elected officials are up-to-date through March 1997.","Purpose: Planning, display and analysis."],"dct_creator_sm":["MassGIS (Office : Mass.)","Massachusetts. General Court. Senate","Electronic Data Services, Inc.","Applied Geographics, Inc."],"dct_publisher_sm":["Office of Geographic and Environmental Information (MassGIS)"],"schema_provider_s":"Harvard","gbl_resourceClass_sm":["Datasets"],"gbl_resourceType_sm":["Polygon data"],"dct_subject_sm":["Election districts","Administrative and political division","Legislators"],"dcat_theme_sm":["Boundaries"],"dct_temporal_sm":["1997-03"],"dct_issued_s":"1997-03","gbl_indexYear_im":[1997],"dct_spatial_sm":["Massachusetts"],"locn_geometry":"ENVELOPE(-73.50814,-69.927802,42.88679,41.237962)","dcat_bbox":"ENVELOPE(-73.50814,-69.927802,42.88679,41.237962)","dct_rights_sm":["Use constraints: For non-commercial use only.","Access constraints: None.","Data credit: When using MassGIS data on maps or in digital applications, source credit should be stated as \"MassGIS, Commonwealth of Massachusetts Executive Office of Environmental Affairs\""],"dct_accessRights_s":"Public","dct_format_s":"Shapefile","dct_references_s":"{\"http://www.opengis.net/cat/csw/csdgm\":\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/harvard-library/harvard-geodata/main/fgdc/MGISSENATEP1.xml\",\"http://schema.org/downloadUrl\":\"https://mps.lib.harvard.edu/assets/file/hgl:MGISSENATEP1\",\"https://github.com/protomaps/PMTiles\":\"https://hgl.harvard.edu/data/public/MGISSENATEP1.pmtiles\"}","id":"harvard-mgissenatep1","gbl_mdModified_dt":"2007-06-13T00:00:00Z","gbl_mdVersion_s":"Aardvark","dct_language_sm":["eng"],"dct_identifier_sm":["https://h